<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 10 bln esc 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 10 bln esc 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 10 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at an average 6.5 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender effective on Monday.</p>
</text>
